---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Bendigo Phoenix Basketball Club, our mission, policies and the Slam Dunk Bridging Fund.">
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-brand-purple py-12 lg:py-8 px-4 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
      <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-64 h-64 rounded-full" style="background: #8B7536;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-brand-gold font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight">ABOUT</h1>
      <div class="h-1 w-16 bg-brand-gold mx-auto mt-4"></div>
      <p class="text-purple-200 mt-4 text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Learn about our club story, values, and commitment to every player.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-purple uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">A Community for Every Player</h2>
          <div class="h-1 w-12 bg-brand-gold mb-6"></div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Founded in 2003, Phoenix United Basketball Development Club has been bringing together players of all ages and skill levels with a shared love for the game. Whether you're new to basketball or you've been shooting hoops for years, Phoenix is a place where everyone can grow, connect, and thrive.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-brand-black">A Club Built on Camaraderie and Personal Growth</strong><br />
            At Phoenix, basketball isn't just about the game—it's about the journey. The club's mission is to foster a supportive environment that promotes athletic skill development, camaraderie, discipline, and personal growth. From the first dribble to the final buzzer, we believe in teamwork and mutual respect taking center stage. It's not just about winning games—it's about building lifelong relationships and cultivating the skills that help players excel both on and off the court.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-brand-black">Something for Everyone</strong><br />
            At Phoenix, we pride ourselves on offering something for everyone, regardless of experience or skill level. New players will find a welcoming environment where they can learn the basics, while seasoned athletes will be challenged to elevate their game. Whether you're aiming for a spot on the competitive team or simply want to enjoy basketball in a fun, recreational setting, Phoenix ensures there's a place for you.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            We understand that cost can be a barrier to sports participation, which is why Phoenix Basketball Club keeps its fees among the lowest in Bendigo. We believe that every child—regardless of background—should have the opportunity to be part of a team, learn valuable life skills, and experience the joy of the game.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {[
            { icon: '🤝', title: 'Community First', desc: 'We put our community at the heart of everything we do.' },
            { icon: '⭐', title: 'Development Focused', desc: 'Helping every player reach their potential, whatever their skill level.' },
            { icon: '🏆', title: 'Competitive Spirit', desc: 'Striving for excellence on and off the court.' },
            { icon: '❤️', title: 'Inclusive Culture', desc: 'Basketball for everyone — no one gets left behind.' },
          ].map(val => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-offwhite border border-gray-300">
              <span class="text-3xl flex-shrink-0">{val.icon}</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-black text-sm">{val.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-0.5">{val.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Slam Dunk Bridging Fund -->
  <section id="slam-dunk" class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-brand-offwhite">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-brand-gold bg-white overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-brand-gold px-6 py-4">
          <h2 class="text-white font-black text-xl uppercase tracking-wide">🏀 Slam Dunk Bridging Fund</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                The Slam Dunk Bridging Fund exists to ensure no player misses out on the opportunity to play
                basketball due to financial hardship.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                If you or your family are experiencing financial difficulty and need assistance with registration
                fees, please contact us confidentially. All applications are handled with complete discretion
                and respect.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                We believe every young person deserves the chance to play and benefit from the life lessons
                that sport provides. This fund makes that possible.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-brand-offwhite rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center gap-4">
              <span class="text-5xl">🤝</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-purple text-lg">Apply Confidentially</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Contact us at any time — your privacy is completely protected.
              </p>
              <a
                href="mailto:hello@bendigophoenix.org.au?subject=Slam%20Dunk%20Bridging%20Fund%20Enquiry"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-purple text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm hover:bg-purple-800 transition-colors"
              >
                ✉️ Contact Us
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <img
          src="/images/about/bridging_slam_dunk.png"
          alt="Slam Dunk Bridging Fund poster"
          class="h-auto w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

